00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:45.680
you actually see it tells you,
you have money.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:46.560
Now where is that money?

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:50.320
It's not actually on your computer.

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:55.040
It's not even at Bank of America because
