00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:26.130
And when a message is sent on that ledger,
Bank of

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:29.950
America could promise to honor a contract,
to send that money to someone else.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:33.060
Okay?
So if I wanted to send money to someone in

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:37.400
