00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:59.380
And that message is gonna say that
I'm sending someone else money and

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:01.390
who's account it's supposed to go to?

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:04.120
But on the back end,
that's not at all what happens.

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:06.970
On the back end, say Bank of America
